sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as Distress Node
    participant GPS as Android LocationManager
    participant Mesh as Mesh Engine
    participant Rescuer as Rescuer Node

    User->>GPS: Request High-Accuracy Coordinates
    GPS-->>User: Lat, Lon, Accuracy
    User->>User: Format Payload: [ALERT] id, title, coords
    User->>User: Encrypt Payload via AES-256

    User->>Mesh: Broadcast MeshMessage(BROADCAST_ALERT, hop=0)
    Mesh->>Mesh: Store in AlertCustodyStore (DTN buffer)
    Mesh->>Rescuer: Relay across Nearby and Wi-Fi Direct

    Note over Rescuer: Rescuer receives emergency SOS
    Rescuer->>Rescuer: Deduplicate via DuplicateSuppressionCache
    Rescuer->>Rescuer: Decrypt AES-256 Payload
    Rescuer->>Rescuer: Plot SOS Pin on Tactical Offline Map
    Rescuer->>Rescuer: Trigger Visual Banner & Audible SOS Alarm

    Note over Rescuer: Rescuer locates missing person
    Rescuer->>User: Send Direct [FOUND_PERSON] with Rescuer GPS
    User->>User: Update Alert Status to FOUND & Notify User